sequenceDiagram
  participant View as CopilotView
  participant API as FastAPI /api/chat
  participant Graph as discovery_graph
  participant Data as restaurants.json
  participant Web as Bing HTML
  View->>View: followUpContext from cards already shown
  View->>API: query, user_id, session_id, context
  API->>Graph: run_discovery_graph
  Graph->>Graph: intent and apply_history
  Graph->>Data: filter then BM25
  Data-->>Graph: canonical rows
  Graph->>Web: search when the demo flag is on
  Web-->>Graph: source pages or an error
  Graph-->>API: answer, results, constraints, trace
  API-->>View: ChatResponse JSON
  View->>View: render cards and coordinate pins
